WEBVTT

00:09:29.912 --> 00:09:31.704
and she told me that her husband Abed

00:09:31.704 --> 00:09:33.579
would be home from work in four hours.

00:09:34.204 --> 00:09:37.079
Her Hebrew was not good,
and she later confessed

00:09:37.121 --> 00:09:40.079
that she thought that I had come
to install the internet.

00:09:40.412 --> 00:09:43.287
(Laughter)

00:09:43.996 --> 00:09:46.537
I drove off and returned at 4:30,

00:09:46.537 --> 00:09:49.829
thankful to the minaret up the road
that helped me find my way back.

00:09:50.704 --> 00:09:52.412
And as I approached the front door,

00:09:52.454 --> 00:09:55.912
Abed saw me, my jeans
and flannel and cane,

00:09:55.954 --> 00:09:57.787
and I saw Abed,

00:09:57.829 --> 00:10:00.412
an average-looking man of average size.